<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Install School Certificate</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme-c.css" />
</head>
<body class="landing-home">
  <%- include('partials/main-header-card') %>
  <main class="container stack certificate-help-shell">
    <section class="card certificate-help-card">
      <h2>Install School Certificate</h2>
      <p class="muted">Download the school root certificate, install it on your device, then reopen the secure portal.</p>
      <p class="muted">If you are seeing the regular portal over HTTP, that does not mean the certificate is missing. It only means this visit is not currently using HTTPS.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="btn" href="<%= caDownloadPath %>">Download CRT File</a>
        <% if (httpsUrl) { %>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="<%= httpsUrl %>">Open Secure Portal</a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card certificate-help-card">
      <h3>Android</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Download the CRT file to your phone.</li>
        <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong>.</li>
        <li>Go to <strong>Security</strong> or <strong>Encryption &amp; credentials</strong>.</li>
        <li>Choose <strong>Install a certificate</strong>.</li>
        <li>Select the downloaded CRT file and approve the installation.</li>
        <li>Close and reopen your browser, then open the secure portal.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="card certificate-help-card">
      <h3>iPhone / iPad</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Download the CRT file to the device.</li>
        <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong> and install the downloaded profile.</li>
        <li>Go to <strong>Settings &gt; General &gt; About &gt; Certificate Trust Settings</strong>.</li>
        <li>Enable full trust for the installed school root certificate.</li>
        <li>Close and reopen the browser, then open the secure portal.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
